WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.4 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Onboarding

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Good onboarding builds safe, confident people, not just people who received documents.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Plan the first day, first week and first month.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check readiness before anyone works alone.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Ask each newcomer what was missing.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Day one: contract, insurance and food safety explained; week one with a buddy; by week three, a first loaf that passes the quality check.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a 30-day onboarding plan and working agreements.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
